   "text": "A few years ago we built a 6-day bootcamp to teach LinkedIn growth.\n\nIt never launched.\n\nWe were stuck in the cycle of servicing clients. Operations were still a bottleneck.\n\nThat bootcamp taught me more than any launch would have: a process that isn't written down can't run without you.\n\nWhen a founder later asked how we run things, I showed him our standard operating procedures. His reaction is on the card.\n\nHere's what writing them taught me:\n\n1. Write each procedure the way you'd hand it to a new hire on day one.\n2. Give every step an owner, an input and a test for done.\n3. A good procedure surprises the expert, not just the beginner.\n\nThat's what the 3-Day AI RevOps Workshop builds with you: the decisions on Day 1, every page and sequence on Day 2, and an AI agent running it on Day 3.\n\nIf you left for a month, which part of your funnel would stop?",
